"This is the part people get wrong. A passphrase does not put a password on your account. It opens a completely different account. Your 12 or 24 words with no passphrase open one account. The same words with the word \"apple\" opens another one. With \"banana\", another one again. Every passphrase is its own separate account, with its own address and its own balance." = "这是人们最容易搞错的地方。密码短语并不是给你的账户加一个密码，而是打开一个完全不同的账户。不使用密码短语时，你的 12 或 24 个单词打开一个账户；同样的单词加上 \"apple\" 会打开另一个账户，加上 \"banana\" 又是另一个。每个密码短语都是一个独立的账户，有自己的地址和余额。";
