"How KaPost Uses Kaspa" = "KaPost 如何使用 Kaspa";
"Every post, reply, like and room message is a small transaction on the Kaspa network, signed by your account. The fee goes to the miners who secure the network." = "每条帖子、回复、点赞和房间消息都是 Kaspa 网络上的一笔小交易，由你的账户签名。费用归保护网络的矿工所有。";
